  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Once a promising scholar at the esteemed Quackademics, Professor Phibblesworth's obsession with forbidden blood magic led to his expulsion and a permanent staining of his feathers with crimson. Now he roams Subchain City, seeking forgotten arcane knowledge amidst the decaying ruins, driven by the whispers of the El Fantasma crown he wears.",
    "class": "Arcane Scavenger",
    "name": "Professor Phibblesworth, the Blood-Stained",
    "personality": "Eccentric and macabre, Phibblesworth alternates between moments of lucid brilliance and crazed ramblings about forgotten rituals. Despite his unsettling appearance, he possesses a dry wit and a surprising fondness for the battered Stitchy doll he carries. He's also a bit of a fashion disaster, but he owns it.",
